{
    "title": "Preggers: Pregnancy & Baby App",
    "description": "Embark on the journey of parenthood with Preggers, the must-have app trusted by over a million expectant parents worldwide! Dive into a one-of-a-kind 3D experience of your baby's growth and development.\r\n\r\n\"Preggers offers the most medically correct, lifelike animations of child development during pregnancy that I've ever seen.\"\r\n\u2013 Eeva Itkonen, certified midwife\r\n\r\nPreggers: Your Trusted Companion from Pregnancy to Parenthood. Gain access to Weekly Updates, Checklists, Articles, Trending Names, Safe Workouts, and Pelvic Exercises.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc95 Download Preggers today! \ud83d\udc95\r\n\r\nAmazing 3D experience \ud83d\udc76\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Follow your unique baby, because all children are different.\r\n\u2714\ufe0f See their development from an unfertilised egg to a fully developed baby\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Get information and highlights from the development of your child\r\n\u2714\ufe0f See your child's actual size \u2013 zoom and rotate to see all the details\r\n\r\nInformation \ud83e\udd30\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Pregnancy stats - even for those with C-sections and planned inducement\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Your child's size is visualised every week, with cute fruits, animals, and other things\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Weekly information on all the amazing changes that are happening\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Articles are written by experts from different fields\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Subscribe to trending podcasts about children and families\r\n \r\nFunctions & Tools \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Get help estimating the first, preliminary delivery date\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Share your pregnancy journey and smart tools with loved ones\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Dark theme (perfect for nighttime reading) and other colour themes for a more personal experience \r\n\u2714\ufe0f Custom exercises before, during, and after the pregnancy, created by experts\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Search from thousands of baby names in our generator, and see what the trending names for the current year are\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Smart checklist with everything that you need for your new family member\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Pelvic floor exercises that are simple and fun to do\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Searchable food guide to make quick everyday decisions easier\r\n \r\nImmortalise your journey \ud83d\udcf8\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Diary where you can save all your thoughts, memories, and photos\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Bump Booth \u2013 a photo function with cute stickers for your pictures\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Share your pregnancy on social media\r\n\r\nOnly available in the Preggers app \ud83d\udc8e\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Unique 3-D experience with the development of your child and information about your pregnancy\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Information about the pregnant body, illustrated with a unique 3D experience\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Stats even for those with C-section and planned inducement\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Animated, interactive size comparisons, shown with cute fruits, animals, and other items \r\n\u2714\ufe0f In the diary, every entry has information about the week of pregnancy or the age of your child, so you can easily look back on your memories\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Create memories in your child's diary together with your loved ones\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Trending names for the current year and the option to share with your loved ones \r\n\u2714\ufe0f Beautiful design, dark mode, and different coloured themes for a more personal experience \r\n\u2714\ufe0f Price comparison function that helps you find the best price \u2013 available in select countries\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Exclusive information for everything you need to acquire\r\n\r\nInformation in the app\r\nPreggers guides you through your pregnancy and the toddler years and shows you relevant information for your current week or child's age.  You can feel safe and secure knowing that the contents of the app have been produced in collaboration with experts on pregnancy, children, exercise, and more.  The app is updated continuously to make the greatest adventure of your life a bit easier, and to contribute to a good start for the whole family.\r\n\r\nJoin us on SoMe \ud83d\udcf1\r\nFollow us on Facebook, Instagram, and TikTok for more updates, tips, and community engagement. We're thrilled to be a part of your journey, providing joy, knowledge, and support to your whole family!\r\n\r\nFacebook: facebook.com/preggersapp\r\nInstagram: @preggers.app\r\nTikTok: @preggers.app\r\n\r\nWith love from the Preggers team \ud83d\udc95",
    "descriptionHTML": "Embark on the journey of parenthood with Preggers, the must-have app trusted by over a million expectant parents worldwide! Dive into a one-of-a-kind 3D experience of your baby&#39;s growth and development.<br><br>&quot;Preggers offers the most medically correct, lifelike animations of child development during pregnancy that I&#39;ve ever seen.&quot;<br>\u2013 Eeva Itkonen, certified midwife<br><br>Preggers: Your Trusted Companion from Pregnancy to Parenthood. Gain access to Weekly Updates, Checklists, Articles, Trending Names, Safe Workouts, and Pelvic Exercises.<br><br>\ud83d\udc95 Download Preggers today! \ud83d\udc95<br><br>Amazing 3D experience \ud83d\udc76<br>\u2714\ufe0f Follow your unique baby, because all children are different.<br>\u2714\ufe0f See their development from an unfertilised egg to a fully developed baby<br>\u2714\ufe0f Get information and highlights from the development of your child<br>\u2714\ufe0f See your child&#39;s actual size \u2013 zoom and rotate to see all the details<br><br>Information \ud83e\udd30<br>\u2714\ufe0f Pregnancy stats - even for those with C-sections and planned inducement<br>\u2714\ufe0f Your child&#39;s size is visualised every week, with cute fruits, animals, and other things<br>\u2714\ufe0f Weekly information on all the amazing changes that are happening<br>\u2714\ufe0f Articles are written by experts from different fields<br>\u2714\ufe0f Subscribe to trending podcasts about children and families<br> <br>Functions &amp; Tools \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f<br>\u2714\ufe0f Get help estimating the first, preliminary delivery date<br>\u2714\ufe0f Share your pregnancy journey and smart tools with loved ones<br>\u2714\ufe0f Dark theme (perfect for nighttime reading) and other colour themes for a more personal experience <br>\u2714\ufe0f Custom exercises before, during, and after the pregnancy, created by experts<br>\u2714\ufe0f Search from thousands of baby names in our generator, and see what the trending names for the current year are<br>\u2714\ufe0f Smart checklist with everything that you need for your new family member<br>\u2714\ufe0f Pelvic floor exercises that are simple and fun to do<br>\u2714\ufe0f Searchable food guide to make quick everyday decisions easier<br> <br>Immortalise your journey \ud83d\udcf8<br>\u2714\ufe0f Diary where you can save all your thoughts, memories, and photos<br>\u2714\ufe0f Bump Booth \u2013 a photo function with cute stickers for your pictures<br>\u2714\ufe0f Share your pregnancy on social media<br><br>Only available in the Preggers app \ud83d\udc8e<br>\u2714\ufe0f Unique 3-D experience with the development of your child and information about your pregnancy<br>\u2714\ufe0f Information about the pregnant body, illustrated with a unique 3D experience<br>\u2714\ufe0f Stats even for those with C-section and planned inducement<br>\u2714\ufe0f Animated, interactive size comparisons, shown with cute fruits, animals, and other items <br>\u2714\ufe0f In the diary, every entry has information about the week of pregnancy or the age of your child, so you can easily look back on your memories<br>\u2714\ufe0f Create memories in your child&#39;s diary together with your loved ones<br>\u2714\ufe0f Trending names for the current year and the option to share with your loved ones <br>\u2714\ufe0f Beautiful design, dark mode, and different coloured themes for a more personal experience <br>\u2714\ufe0f Price comparison function that helps you find the best price \u2013 available in select countries<br>\u2714\ufe0f Exclusive information for everything you need to acquire<br><br>Information in the app<br>Preggers guides you through your pregnancy and the toddler years and shows you relevant information for your current week or child&#39;s age.  You can feel safe and secure knowing that the contents of the app have been produced in collaboration with experts on pregnancy, children, exercise, and more.  The app is updated continuously to make the greatest adventure of your life a bit easier, and to contribute to a good start for the whole family.<br><br>Join us on SoMe \ud83d\udcf1<br>Follow us on Facebook, Instagram, and TikTok for more updates, tips, and community engagement. We&#39;re thrilled to be a part of your journey, providing joy, knowledge, and support to your whole family!<br><br>Facebook: facebook.com/preggersapp<br>Instagram: @preggers.app<br>TikTok: @preggers.app<br><br>With love from the Preggers team \ud83d\udc95",
